# AI-native workflow

- Treat `AGENTS.md` and `ai/` as the canonical instructions.
- The main agent is an orchestrator and must not implement production code.
- After the Validation Manifest, delegate a read-only `planner`, then writes to `implementer`; use fresh `reviewer` and `verifier` contexts.
- Follow `plan -> implement -> review -> fix -> verify -> PR`.
- Never approve with BLOCKER/MAJOR findings or missing/failing required checks.
- Preserve the product/architecture documents as source of truth.
